**Placement of the "In particular, …" sentences.**  Following the house rule
(`CONVENTIONS.md` §3.7) and the precedent of `Workspace.Statements.S14`
(statement 14.3), the closing sentence of 23.2, 23.4 and 23.5 is genuine
